  "text": "\r\n\t\t Alert Center • Town Clerk Alerts \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     Visitors   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\nHome \nAlert Center \r\nAlert Center \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAlert Center allows you to view all alerts and emergencies in your area. If there are alerts or emergencies,  they will be listed below by category. To be instantly notified of alerts and emergencies subscribe to  Notify Me®  or  RSS .\r\nTown Clerk Alerts \r\n\t\t\t\t\t 1  Alert \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t August 10, 2026 8:00 AM \r\nWolfeboro Town Clerk's Office closed on Fridays starting August 14, 2026 \r\nEffective Immediately  \nthe Wolfeboro Town Clerk’s Office  \nwill be closed on Friday’s commencing on  \nAugust 14th, 2026 until further notice. \nPlease plan accordingly. \nPatricia M. Waterman, Town Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Wolfeboro Town Clerk's Office closed on Fridays starting August 14, 2026 Read On... \r\n                         Module Search \r\n                     Enter Search Terms \r\n                     Select a Category \r\n\t\t All Categories \r\n\t\t Town Clerk Alerts \r\nTools \r\nRSS \r\nNotify Me \r\nShow Archived \r\nCategories \r\nAll Categories \r\nTown Clerk Alerts \r\nLive Edit \n\t\t\t Minutes & Agendas \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Town Calendar \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Contact Us \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Forms & Documents \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Recreation \nLearn more \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Wolfeboro \r\n84 S Main Street \r\nP.O. Box 629 \r\nWolfeboro, New Hampshire 03894 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Public Notices \n         Hours \n         Property Tax Bills \n         Pay Utility Bills \n         Bids & RFPs \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Contact Us \n         Website Sign-In \n         Site Map \n     